# Phase 5 transcript (T-U6c): an edit of a file whose lines hold the
# default-ignorable code points fx v0.0.16 writes as themselves and tmux 3.7b
# draws a cell wide (a soft hyphen, the Hangul fillers, U+FFF0), one line
# short and one that reaches the screen's last column by xfx's count and
# past it by the terminal's; read first on both sides, then Ctrl-O over the
# change.
gateway p5-transcript-diffwide-turns.json
fx: env FX_AUTO_UPGRADE=0
fx: env FX_PERMISSION_MODE=yolo
xfx: env XFX_PERMISSION_MODE=yolo
work p5-transcript-diffwidews
keep
wait 4
type edit the file
wait 1
key Enter
wait 5
snap edited
key C-o
wait 2
snap full
key C-o
wait 1
snap closed
gwlog
